--------------------------------------------------
History
--------------------------------------------------

Every successful state-changing operation must create a record inside:

tenant_subscription_history

Including:

- action
- previous_plan_id
- new plan
- performed_by
- notes
- timestamp

No state transition should occur without History.

--------------------------------------------------
Snapshot
--------------------------------------------------

When subscribing or changing plans,
refresh all snapshot fields from subscription_plan.

Never rely on reading subscription_plan later to know historical limits.

