Kysely

Never use Prisma inside Query repositories.

--------------------------------------------------
Application Services
--------------------------------------------------

Application Services should only:

- load entities
- call Domain methods
- persist changes
- create History
- return DTOs

Business decisions belong only inside Domain.

--------------------------------------------------
Code Quality
--------------------------------------------------

Do not over-engineer.

