- execute domain operation
- refresh snapshot
- save subscription
- create history
- return DTO

Business rules must never be duplicated here.

────────────────────────────────────────
Creation
────────────────────────────────────────

Subscribe is NOT a method on an existing subscription.

Instead:

The Application Service creates a new Domain object.

The Domain represents an existing subscription.

Therefore expose methods only for existing subscriptions:

changePlan()

suspend()

resume()

cancel()

expire()

Creation happens outside those methods.

