────────────────────────────────────────
Domain Invariants
────────────────────────────────────────

The Domain must enforce important invariants.

Examples:

A Tenant cannot have more than one ACTIVE subscription.

Cannot Resume a CANCELLED subscription.

Cannot Resume an EXPIRED subscription.

Cannot Suspend an already SUSPENDED subscription.

Cannot Change Plan if there is no subscription.

Cannot Create a subscription if another ACTIVE subscription already exists.

Throw Domain Exceptions whenever invariants are violated.

────────────────────────────────────────
History
────────────────────────────────────────

History is NOT part of the Domain.

The Domain never creates history records.

After a successful Domain operation,

the Application Service must create:

tenant_subscription_history

inside the same Prisma transaction.

