Snapshots
────────────────────────────────────────

Whenever subscribing or changing plans,

refresh every snapshot field from subscription_plan.

Never depend on subscription_plan later to know historical limits.

────────────────────────────────────────
Transactions
────────────────────────────────────────

Use Prisma transactions.

Do NOT introduce a Unit Of Work abstraction.

Use prisma.$transaction() directly inside the Command Repository whenever multiple writes must succeed atomically.

